.Dd June 12, 2026
.Dt LIBCREG 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm libcreg.h
.Nd Library to access the Windows 9x/Me Registry File (CREG) format
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In libcreg.h
.Pp
